                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Beaupré.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1903-08-15"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                                15, 1903</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Cable additional information concerning rejection of treaty as soon as
                    possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
